                        "entry_id": "5918806f-78bf-3577-9b66-459f48a254f2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sight for that which is on the outside; the ability or capacity to perceive or anticipate external things; view; outlook; perspective; power of observation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "65e94663-a8f3-4971-b131-1fb09d5ea1a0",
                                "sense_id": "c988760a-105d-3339-bd62-ddc8c61bbf21",
                                "text": "When we live by outsight, we become submissive to fate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b06adb2c-a01e-409b-bc88-832650a69482",
                                "sense_id": "c988760a-105d-3339-bd62-ddc8c61bbf21",
                                "text": "It can key her into broad areas of emotional import, and therefore of personal significance, which if made relevant to the subject matter would provide some children with opportunities for linking insights to outsights, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79021610-4b2d-4753-b204-d4c0ca79ac15",
                                "sense_id": "c988760a-105d-3339-bd62-ddc8c61bbf21",
                                "text": "This means honing their “outsight” —the capacity to perceive external things—and helping their constituents develop that ability as well."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bfcc0c46-667a-3318-8448-9847faf7f151",
                        "entry_id": "5918806f-78bf-3577-9b66-459f48a254f2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Expectation; prospect."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef7a4732-a714-4543-8acd-c6958427f871",
                                "sense_id": "bfcc0c46-667a-3318-8448-9847faf7f151",
                                "text": "Yet we sail toward it grasping The outsight which we know is there."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7764522d-dd3d-366b-a4b1-7e290f3eb188",
